  "backpack ammo supply": {
    "name": "Backpack Ammo Supply",
    "packId": "impmal-core",
    "item": {
      "name": "Backpack Ammo Supply",
      "type": "modification",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/modification/modification.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "<p>Backpack Ammo Supplies utilise back-mounted drum magazines, thrumming power packs, or oversized fuel canisters to drastically increase the amount of ammunition a weapon can hold. Unfortunately, they are both heavy and dangerous, as carrying so much volatile material into battle makes every stray shot potentially fatal.</p><p>A Backpack Ammo Supply quadruples a linked weapon's Magazine size, but adds +1 Enc when worn. The Backpack Ammo Supply takes 5 minutes to reload. In addition, if you suffer a @UUID[JournalEntry.hdElQAwiBr5AyoRf.JournalEntryPage.UaRHLqZ99zmg7AeE#critical-hit]{Critical Hit} while wearing a Backpack Ammo Supply, roll [[/r 1d10]]. On a result of 7+, the backpack detonates, dealing double the weapon's Damage to your Torso. The Backpack Ammo Supply is permanently destroyed if it explodes in this way. A Backpack Ammo Supply has the same Availability and Cost as the linked weapon. Enough ammo to fill the Backpack costs four times the listed price for reloads for the linked weapon.</p>",
          "gm": ""
        },
        "encumbrance": {
          "value": 0
        },
        "cost": 0,
        "availability": "",
        "quantity": 1,
        "category": "support",
        "usedWith": "Any Ranged Weapon",
        "addedTraits": {
          "list": []
        },
        "removedTraits": {
          "list": []
        },
        "enabled": true,
        "disabled": false
      },
      "effects": [],
      "sort": 0,
      "flags": {},
