  "laser sight": {
    "name": "Laser Sight",
    "packId": "impmal-core",
    "item": {
      "name": "Laser Sight",
      "type": "modification",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/modification/modification.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "<p>This attachment uses a low-power laser to pick out a target so that the user can more easily make a kill shot. Others (including the target) may notice the appearance of the small red dot, though, revealing the shooter's presence.</p><p>A Laser Sight adds +1 SL to Ranged Attacks made with the weapon, but targets have Advantage on Awareness Tests to spot the wielder. An unaware target who notices the dot may attempt to Dodge the ranged attack. The sight may be switched on or off once per round as a Free Action.</p>",
          "gm": ""
        },
        "encumbrance": {
          "value": 0
        },
        "cost": 50,
        "availability": "scarce",
